'''Eldritch Forces Invasion''' is an [[Invasion Stage]] that appears in {{4c}} [[Laboratory of Relics]] after clearing all [[Stories of Legend]] sub-chapters on all Crown difficulties. [[Idi:Re]] debuts here.

Upon completion, [[Eldritch Forces]] will be back to normal and [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N]] will be unlocked. Like the original Eldritch Forces, this is a [[No Continues]] stage.

