==Trivia==
*This is the only [[Stories of Legend]] stage to feature [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic Enemies]] and drop Ammonites.
**It is also the only [[Invasion Stage]] in Stories of Legend.
*This stage reuses "Big Bang Kumikyoku", a [[Music|unique theme]] that is otherwise only heard in [[The Big Bang (Cats of the Cosmos)|The Big Bang]], [[Moon (Aku Realm)|Aku Realms Moon/Iriomote]], [[Ruthless Tyrant (Merciless)|Ruthless Tyrant]], [[Ape Lord's Revenge]] and [[The Face of God/Invasion|The Face of God Invasion]].
*{{4c}} Eldritch Forces and its Invasion Stage can both be accessed before the completion of its 2 and {{3c}} versions if all other Stories of Legend sub-chapters have been cleared on every difficulty beforehand. The button to select the {{4c}} difficulty will remain grayed out when viewing it even after finishing the stage, though will light up once the preceding difficulties have been cleared as usual.

